1754..1831 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1832..1906 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1907..1984 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
1985..2059 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2060..2087 Comment "/// endpoints alone (#427)."
